      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/67e7ee/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-27T15:48:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am sure this has come up before so forgive my newbieness.&nbsp; When a card states that it can target more than one card, or \"up\" to a certain number of targets, are you allowed to choose the same target card more than once during the effect?&nbsp; An example would be inflict 2 damage on up to two targets.&nbsp; Can the same target be chosen 2x?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for the info!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Razman</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:12.250Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 1,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 5.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 7828,
      "topic_slug": "targeting-question",
      "display_username": "razman_20",
      "primary_group_name": null,
