      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-27T16:03:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No, they have to be different targets. An example of a card that could hit the same target twice is Rocket Punch from Omni-X, which says \"Deal 1 target 2 projectile. Deal 1 target 1 projectile\" since it doesn't say \"second target\" it is one of the few cards that do that.</p>",
